WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:15.297
"This is such a lovely day."

2
00:00:15.817 --> 00:00:16.978
A woman was with her neighbors.

3
00:00:18.438 --> 00:00:20.779
They were having a party on the roof of their apartment building.

4
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.380
A man smiled.

5
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.862
"I'm glad we got rid of that smelly hawk's nest."

6
00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:29.443
Another neighbor grinned.

7
00:00:29.463 --> 00:00:32.084
"Our building is much nicer now."

8
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.521
Kee, kee!

9
00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:39.202
A winged figure swooped down from the sky.

10
00:00:39.222 --> 00:00:43.664
"Ahh!" The woman screamed.

11
00:00:43.684 --> 00:00:47.906
"Cool!" Jack said.

12
00:00:47.926 --> 00:00:53.008
"Vultures!" Roxy and her friends were at the Metro City Raptor Center.

13
00:00:53.968 --> 00:00:56.329
The center had lots of raptors in large cages.

14
00:00:58.170 --> 00:00:59.071
A woman walked over.

15
00:01:00.131 --> 00:01:01.712
She wore a name tag that read Robin.

16
00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:05.787
"Those are turkey vultures," Robin said.

17
00:01:05.807 --> 00:01:08.909
"Vultures are a type of raptor.

18
00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:12.172
Raptors are birds that hunt other animals."

19
00:01:12.192 --> 00:01:14.574
"Why are they here?"

20
00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:15.695
Mara asked.

21
00:01:15.715 --> 00:01:19.558
"Those vultures got injured," Robin said.

22
00:01:19.578 --> 00:01:21.600
"We helped them get better.

23
00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.642
Soon we'll release them back into the wild."

24
00:01:27.485 --> 00:01:29.406
Robin led everyone to another large cage.

25
00:01:30.487 --> 00:01:31.388
"This is Perry.

26
00:01:31.828 --> 00:01:33.269
He's a peregrine falcon.

27
00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:35.431
Perry's wing is broken.

28
00:01:35.892 --> 00:01:37.593
We think he got hit by a car."

29
00:01:37.613 --> 00:01:40.876
"That's awful," Jack said.

30
00:01:40.896 --> 00:01:44.939
"The person driving the car didn't even stop."

31
00:01:46.441 --> 00:01:48.062
Robin's eyes flashed with anger.

32
00:01:52.005 --> 00:01:55.649
need to be nicer to birds, especially raptors.

33
00:01:56.369 --> 00:01:59.352
Raptors are great hunters with amazing eyesight.

34
00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.423
Vultures even help the environment by cleaning up dead animals."

35
00:02:03.443 --> 00:02:07.987
"There's a bird's nest outside my window," Terrell said.

36
00:02:08.007 --> 00:02:10.809
"I love looking at the baby birds."

37
00:02:12.891 --> 00:02:15.113
"Well, some people don't like nests!"

38
00:02:15.433 --> 00:02:17.035
Robin looked very angry now.

39
00:02:17.055 --> 00:02:22.239
"There was a beautiful hawk's nest on an apartment building near Metro City Park.

40
00:02:24.241 --> 00:02:27.464
The building's horrible residents had the nest removed!"

41
00:02:28.684 --> 00:02:30.225
"That stinks," Jack said.

42
00:02:31.446 --> 00:02:32.607
Suddenly Robin looked up.

43
00:02:33.828 --> 00:02:35.609
A large bird was flying overhead.

44
00:02:35.629 --> 00:02:37.850
"I'll be right back."

45
00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:40.252
Robin hurried away.

46
00:02:40.272 --> 00:02:43.834
"That was strange," Mara said.

47
00:02:44.595 --> 00:02:45.295
Jack shrugged.

48
00:02:45.315 --> 00:02:49.678
"It's sad that the hawk's nest was removed," Roxy said.

49
00:02:49.698 --> 00:02:51.480
"I love hawks."

50
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.961
"Me too," Jack said.

51
00:02:53.981 --> 00:02:57.544
"Why didn't anyone stop those people from removing it?"

52
00:03:00.384 --> 00:03:02.865
"Rocket Girl could have stopped them," Terrell said.

53
00:03:05.046 --> 00:03:06.067
Mara rolled her eyes.

54
00:03:06.087 --> 00:03:10.889
"I'm sure Rocket Girl has more important things to do, Terrell."

55
00:03:12.709 --> 00:03:14.670
Roxy and Terrell looked at each other and grinned.

56
00:03:15.911 --> 00:03:16.911
Roxy's watch beeped.

57
00:03:19.772 --> 00:03:20.993
She stepped away from her friends.

58
00:03:26.395 --> 00:03:27.956
Bloom? Is something wrong?"

59
00:03:29.088 --> 00:03:30.509
"Rocket Girl, I need your help."

60
00:03:30.909 --> 00:03:31.930
The mayor looked annoyed.

61
00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.853
"Workers are trying to cut down some trees in Metro City Park.

62
00:03:36.394 --> 00:03:37.454
They were just attacked.

63
00:03:37.975 --> 00:03:39.856
All their equipment was destroyed."

64
00:03:39.876 --> 00:03:43.119
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

65
00:03:43.139 --> 00:03:45.320
"I'm on my way!"
